          <DisplayName>Review The Hop Group!</DisplayName>
          <Enabled>false</Enabled>
          <Height>650</Height>
          <ID>7acf249f-c6ac-4340-b200-39a00ef3e233</ID>
          <Name>gblS_Hop_Screen_Txt</Name>
          <UserControl>false</UserControl>
          <Width>1920</Width>
          <X>0</X>
          <Y>190</Y>
          <Format></Format>
          <Precision>3</Precision>
          <Value>You should review the groupings.  Like Time Hops should be in the same Group.   If you have two Hops that are to be dropped at 60 minutes, and they are the first to be dropped.  They should both be Group 1.      Order Like Time Hops in the same Hop Group and put those groups in order of the drop.   As an example, our TGS has 3 Hops: First to Drop is Target Hops at 60 minutes.  They will be Grouped as  1. Second (and last)  to Drop is both Stryian Golden and Hersberger.  Thay are dropped at 15 minutes.  They  both  will be Grouped as  2.   Make any needed  corrections then click the Main Brewery Switch  (Bottom right) to advance.  This message is displayed for 1 minute.  You may use the Advance Timer (upper right). to end message. </Value>
          <VariableName i:nil="true" />
          <VariableType>String</VariableType>
        </Element>
